  "text": "CCRAS Guideline: Fundamentals of Ayurvedic Preventive Health (Dinacharya) | Publisher: Cen\nAgni (Digestive Fire) and Mild Indigestion\nIn Ayurvedic tradition, mild digestive discomfort or heaviness is\nassociated with temporary low Agni (digestive fire). Traditional Lifestyle\nContext: - Avoid cold, icy drinks immediately after meals. - Allow 3-4\nhours between meals to permit complete digestion. - Engage in gentle\n100-step post-meal walks (Shatapadi).\nPage 2 of 4 | Official Educational Resource",
